# CODEOWNERS — Discovery Catalog
#
# Each line is a file pattern followed by one or more owners. Order matters:
# later patterns take precedence over earlier ones. Owners listed for a
# path are auto-requested for review on any PR that touches the path.
#
# See https://docs.github.com/en/repositories/managing-your-repositories-settings-and-customization/customizing-your-repository/about-code-owners

# Maintainers own every path unless a later rule overrides this default,
# including workflows, validation policy, schemas, and generated registries.
*                                      @microsoft/discovery-samples-maintainer

# Contributions reviewers can approve changes to tests (some internal agents come with tests)
.github/tests                          @microsoft/discovery-samples-maintainer @microsoft/discovery-contributions-reviewers          

# Operator utilities are reviewed by the engineering reviewers.
/utilities/                            @microsoft/discovery-engineering-reviewers

# Discovery Toolbox is maintained separately from the other utilities.
# Releases require maintainer review; REL-002 verifies the VSIX pointer and digest.
/utilities/discovery-toolbox/           @microsoft/discovery-samples-maintainer

# Any of the reviewers/maintainers can review/approve agents and starter-kits
/agents/                                @microsoft/discovery-samples-maintainer @microsoft/discovery-contributions-reviewers
/starter-kits/                          @microsoft/discovery-samples-maintainer @microsoft/discovery-contributions-reviewers
